tempOutdoorAmbient1 OBJECT-TYPE
    SYNTAX TempDegreesDiv10
    MAX-ACCESS read-only
    STATUS current
    DESCRIPTION "Outdoor ambient condenser reference temperature 1 in tenths of deg C"
