humidityReturnGrille OBJECT-TYPE
    SYNTAX Unsigned32 (0..1000)
    MAX-ACCESS read-only
    STATUS current
    DESCRIPTION "Return air relative humidity in tenths of percent RH (e.g. 550 = 55.0 %RH)"
    ::= { brightCv3SemanticTemps 16 }

tempControlGroup1 OBJECT-TYPE
